OL,3,GNEWSAPadel players complete 50-hour    
OL,4,Aworld record bid                       
OL,6,FFour endurance athletes have completed 
OL,7,Fa 50-hour padel marathon in a bid to   
OL,8,Fset a new Guinness World Record and    
OL,9,Fraise money for charity.               
OL,11,FBen Stocken, Jonathan Bamford, Eddie   
OL,12,FEdwards and Will Jones began the       
OL,13,Fchallenge on Thursday at Advantage     
OL,14,FPadel in Mudeford, Dorset, and finished
OL,15,Fon Saturday evening.                   
OL,17,FThe group, known as Padel Gone Bad, has
OL,18,Fraised more than #11,000 for children's
OL,19,Fcharities Julia's House and the Ellis  
OL,20,FEdwards Foundation.                    
